# Trivy CVE allow-list — each entry MUST carry a justification + owner.

# CVE-2024-47554 — apache-commons-io DoS via XmlStreamReader.
# False positive: the resolved/runtime commons-io is 2.18.0 (>= 2.14.0 fixed),
# verified by `mvn dependency:tree -Dincludes=commons-io:commons-io` and by
# BOOT-INF/lib/commons-io-2.18.0.jar in the built artifact. Trivy reports a
# phantom 2.8.0 sourced from transitive Maven metadata inside a pre-built
# internal module (modules/common, modules/pm — source not in this repo), not
# from the active classpath. Risk-accepted; remove if a real commons-io < 2.14
# ever appears in `mvn dependency:tree`.
CVE-2024-47554
